SUMMARY:Dave & Buster's (Wednesday)
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nThis day 
 and time is just a placeholder for feel-out unless we get enough committed
  people. Please let us know your preferred date\, time\, and location in t
 he comments if different from here. I will edit the event accordingly as n
 eeded in trying and accommodate as many people as possible.\n\n(Also let m
 e know if you have any interest in also doing a Saturday or Sunday afterno
 on at the Nyack location since they have a huge mall there as well.)\n\nWe
 dnesday is half price for all games except VR. Everyone is responsible for
  all their own food/drinks games. If sharing games like pool then please s
 plit the cost evenly between each participant.\n\nI’m generally thinking
 : 1. grab a drink/food/chat 2. try to generally stick\, watch\, and rotate
  in together for various games. I’m down for pool and any 2 or more pers
 on arcade games like racing or shooters. But we will try and default to th
 e majority preference no matter what. Let me know what you think!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/315722641/
