DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260725T200000
SUMMARY:V for Volleyball Beach! July25th 1pm-8pm at Sandy Hook Beach Lot C
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nI'm Mike 
 and my son is Mikey/Michael.\nFree to play. We'll have a Wilson ball. Plea
 se bring a ball for the beach.\nWe have a Volleyball NET!\nThey have a foo
 d truck there as well.\nThey have public bathrooms and outdoor showers!\n*
 Bring lotion\, soap\, towels for yourself or to share.*\nIf you have fun a
 nd would like to play with us at other locations\, join us!\n[V for Volley
 ball New Jersey | Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/groups/15873146859754
 34)\n**Sandy Hook Beach parking lot C**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/315000385/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260528T194429Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260528T194429Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: NJ Bowling, Volleyball, Tennis & More
UID:event_315262622@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260722T033335Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260725T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260725T180000
SUMMARY:Casual Volleyball - North Jersey
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nWe're a g
 roup of people who will start by hitting the ball around for the first 20-
 30 minutes and then will break up into 2-4 teams for two or three hours of
  play.\n\nIf we have more than 20 people show up\, we'll break up into thr
 ee or four teams of 6 (Some may have 7\, 8 or 9. Additional players just r
 otate into play). Games will be to 15 points. Rally scoring. Winner stays 
 on (unless a team has won four straight).\n\nWe'll be heading outdoors to 
 the hard court in Leonia off Overpeck County Pk Driveway in the Overpeck C
 ounty Park.\n\n\\*\\*\\*After playing\, we'll be likely heading to Tropica
 l Juice Bar\, an idea of regular attendee Kate\, for a drink and snack. It
 's located at 60 River St. in Hackensack. Feel free to join us or suggest 
 another spot for a post-volleyball hangout. \\*\\*\\*\n\nThere's no fee to
  play volleyball and nothing else you need to do besides show up. Come any
 time!! All are welcome!!! We're not in a league and are not here to analyz
 e your form. We're more for people who haven't played in months\, maybe ye
 ars\, and just want to occasionally play again and hang out.\n\nDirections
 : You can Google "Volleyball Court in Leonia" and it should come up. Or ty
 pe 41 Willow Tree Road\, Leonia\, NJ 07605 into your GPS\, but note that i
 t's not on Willow Tree Road\, just near it. Instead\, turn onto Overpeck C
 ounty Pk Driveway off Fort Lee Road (Degraw Avenue). It is past the tennis
  courts and near a basketball court and track. You can try Googling "Leoni
 a High School" as well. That should help you find it. You can go to the ba
 ck high school parking lot and then cross over the train tracks.\n\nPlease
  note. We don't have the court reserved and if it happens to be taken\, we
  may play with those already occupying it or we will try to relocate on th
 e fly. It's certainly possible that we may have to cancel that day if we c
 an't find a suitable spot. And if it's looking like it'll rain or snow\, I
 'll make a call on whether to cancel around an hour ahead of the scheduled
  start time.\n\nPlease bring a ball and net if you have them for possible 
 use during the game. Feel free to bring a speaker for music\, or snacks an
 d drinks for consumption during play.\n\nIf you have trouble finding the c
 ourt or group\, you can call or text Andy Milone at 201-234-9609. There is
  plenty of parking and an open bathroom at the park.\n\nHope you'll join u
 s for our 20th casual volleyball event. Questions or comments? You can mes
 sage Andy on Meetup\, or call/text him at 201-234-9609. Check out bowling\
 , soccer\, volleyball\, tennis or one of our other activities at: www.meet
 up.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleyball\n\nIf interested in staying 
 touch with group members or conversing about future events\, feel free to 
 inquire about our WhatsApp group chat.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/315262622/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260615T002732Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260615T002732Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
