SUMMARY:Adult Kickball - North Jersey
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nCome join
  us for two to three hours of kickball.\n\nThe event is scheduled for Colu
 mbus Park\, 71 W Franklin St\, Hackensack\, because it has a huge grass fi
 eld.\n\nWe'll grab a kickball\, some bases and split up into teams to play
 . Comment below if you have your own to bring. There are a ton of parking 
 spaces on West Franklin Street.\n\n\\*\\*\\*After playing\, we'll likely b
 e heading to Tropical Juice Bar\, 60 River St.\, Hackensack. Feel free to 
 suggest another spot to hang out if you've got one in mind. \\*\\*\\*\n\nT
 here's no fee to play and nothing else you need to do besides show up. Com
 e anytime!! All are welcome!!! We're not in a league and are not here to a
 nalyze your form. We're here for people who haven't played in months\, may
 be years\, and just want to play again and/or hang out.\n\nHope you'll joi
